@startuml
title SYS-SEQ07  UC07 学生举报并跟踪平台问题
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #111111
    LifeLineBorderColor #777777
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #7A8796
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #222222
    ActorBorderColor #7A8796
    ActorBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ActorFontColor #222222
    GroupBorderColor #F0A060
    GroupHeaderFontColor #333333
    GroupFontColor #333333
    ActivationBorderColor #5E6A78
    ActivationBackgroundColor #DCE8F8
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerBorderColor #999999
}

actor 学生用户 as Student
participant 校园二手交易平台 as System

group 提交举报
    Student -> System : 选择商品、留言或用户并提交举报
    activate System
    System -> System : 识别当前学生并校验举报对象
    alt 举报信息有效
        System -> System : 保存举报内容并生成举报记录
        System --> Student : 返回举报提交成功和记录信息
    else 举报信息无效
        System --> Student : 返回提交失败原因
    end
    deactivate System
end

group 查看本人举报列表
    Student -> System : 请求查看我的举报
    activate System
    System -> System : 仅查询当前用户提交的举报
    System --> Student : 返回本人举报列表及处理状态
    deactivate System
end

group 跟踪举报处理结果
    Student -> System : 打开某条举报详情
    activate System
    System -> System : 校验举报记录归属
    alt 属于当前用户
        System --> Student : 返回处理状态和处理说明
    else 不属于当前用户
        System --> Student : 拒绝查看
    end
    deactivate System
end
@enduml
